<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from</p>
<p>a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $8.29 per</p>
<p>cwt live, up 0.05 when compared to Friday's value.-USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S. TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			   Lbs   Price  Change   Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 4.92   77.00    -	 4.86</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   19.75    -	 0.24</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   18.75    -	 0.84</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  133.00    -	 0.35</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   74.00    0.75    0.24</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   54.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  145.00    -	 0.23</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   28.00    0.50    0.11</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   52.00    -	 0.06</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   36.00    3.00    0.35</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   27.00    0.25    0.18</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   49.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    5.20    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.50    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  267.00   -1.50    0.49</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  565.00    -	 0.17</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   18.65			  8.29</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the five days ending</p>
<p>Friday, July 25, 1997 was estimated at 8.19 per cwt.,</p>
<p>up 0.02 from last week and down -1.10 from last year.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
